71-25/75258663_1012028277387837_7425862253591877070_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ELDIgiGhSVsQ7kNvwHSIcNS&_nc_oc=AdpN4VEhe1YsJzZe5lRjX78t16idg8wi6K_Zg9qJOYLGf9BEbtdsjlolBQh00gnbpwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBWLtOSTfsWpFGiSoRCTTkamnrnS08sSRXxaGcQibP2Qg&oe=6A65F13F"}, "display_name": "SWORD BISTRO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Ingredients Fly Through the Air, and AI Cooks Them!?**\n\nAll the player has to do is slice the ingredients with a sword. \n\nIt's a super easy rhythm action game!\n\n\n**Slice Ingredients Simultaneously! Freshness Up, Meow!**\n\nIf you slice three ingredients simultaneously with perfect timing, the quality of the dish will improve.\n\n\n**Create One-of-a-Kind Dishes!**\n\nThe final dish varies each time based on the sliced ingredients, making it addictive. An image-generating AI using ChatGPT creates unique dishes.\n\n\n**Share Your Finished Dishes on Social Media!**\n\nIs the completed dish delicious-looking? Or perhaps a bit unusual and mysterious? \n\nPost it on social media and have fun with your friends and followers!\n\n**Would you like to grab a sword and enjoy fantasy cooking with cats?**\n{1216381432717385}\n{815571697349553}\n{870447028275041}", "short_description": "Slice and Dice with Ease! Create Fantasy Dishes with AI.\nSimply chop ingredients to the rhythm, and AI will create fantasy dishes for you."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "12.png", "id": "1720013845495589", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974506_1720013848828922_4513314424170558485_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f67XcOPtqyoQ7kNvwH1ssSd&_nc_oc=Adqv9Wff1qS9vOplT-9Tu-QuNADqgN6P0ph5_22TSM_y9-qdlDHuGig4_HD0mTzvXls&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDDtUmsXQBzGj4RYoecGmRTEYf4Shij4eylpYIbvkmLZA&oe=6A65F8B2"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1313009380118968", "image_type": "APP_IMG